{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-13-4","kind":"proposition","title":"大小比较：黄金分割与平方与比例","englishTitle":"If a straight line be cut in extreme and mean ratio, the square on the whole and the square on the lesser segment together are triple of the square on the greater segment.","book":13,"number":4,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.4","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.4/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":4,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-13-4@raw-bc1e5fa87d8f5d80","contentId":"euclid-13-4","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bc1e5fa87d8f5d80700ab93f44999fcffac9fe396321734374b6a3eab783c3db","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-13-4.statement","euclid-13-4.construction.1","euclid-13-4.construction.2","euclid-13-4.proof.1","euclid-13-4.proof.2","euclid-13-4.proof.3","euclid-13-4.proof.4","euclid-13-4.proof.5","euclid-13-4.proof.6","euclid-13-4.conclusion","euclid-13-4.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-13-4.statement","contentId":"euclid-13-4","revisionId":"euclid-13-4@raw-bc1e5fa87d8f5d80","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2cebc4a87ba2b4ccc0679b7557de7894a3f0af37275954349c59d3cde06f1234","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line be cut in extreme and mean ratio, the square on the whole and the square on the lesser segment together are triple of the square on the greater segment."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在黄金分割削减直线,则整个正方形和较小段的正方形是较大段的正方形的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-4.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-13-4","revisionId":"euclid-13-4@raw-bc1e5fa87d8f5d80","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f10dded73d8f2f49c4e313b36ec9e1c21370ffbdc8ef73c60c2f0de941e024e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be a straight line, let it be cut in extreme and mean ratio at C, and let AC be the greater segment; I say that the squares on AB, BC are triple of the square on CA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB线成为一条直线,黄金分割线在C线上被削减,AC线成为更大的数量段;我说,AB正方形,BC是CA正方形的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-4.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-13-4","revisionId":"euclid-13-4@raw-bc1e5fa87d8f5d80","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"abefca59fb1bdad307cc9cb2a4370862fc52ea4b4340361a7e082ceb317703b9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the square ADEB be described on AB, and let the figure be drawn."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ADEB ADEB的描述在AB上,然后绘制数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-4.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-13-4","revisionId":"euclid-13-4@raw-bc1e5fa87d8f5d80","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5a0303a6d913f8e57ae645c4fa2a11d6c2072692fb6758b1aad044d871a64500","citations":["euclid-6-def-3","euclid-6-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then AB has been cut in extreme and mean ratio at C, and AC is the greater segment, therefore the rectangle AB, BC is equal to the square on AC. [[VI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-6-def-3), [VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自此,黄金分割削减了AB, 时速为C, AC是较大的数量部分, 因此, 矩形, AB, BC 等于 AC 时速为 正方形 [ [VI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-6-def-3) [VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-4.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-13-4","revisionId":"euclid-13-4@raw-bc1e5fa87d8f5d80","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f20821d2059cf48dc59ae6afb4211aa113f8ee14e0c90a5788374273c6d5b9db","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And AK is the rectangle AB, BC, and HG the square on AC; therefore AK is equal to HG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AK是矩形 AB,BC,AC是HG,AK等于HG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-4.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-13-4","revisionId":"euclid-13-4@raw-bc1e5fa87d8f5d80","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4973a0497434c012489e9e01780c4c2cd42b963c7605da3668eae5c4f197c484","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AF is equal to FE, let CK be added to each; therefore the whole AK is equal to the whole CE; therefore AK, CE are double of AK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AF等于FE, 每人加CK; 因此, AK 等于 CE 整数; 因此, AK, CE 是 AK 的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-4.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-13-4","revisionId":"euclid-13-4@raw-bc1e5fa87d8f5d80","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec8f4f09de033e0010fba01ae0699c76c6b7e1f78532929a1c0d8feaf9a5c8f9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AK, CE are the gnomon LMN and the square CK; therefore the gnomon LMN and the square CK are double of AK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AK、CE是曲尺形、LMN和正方形,CK;因此,曲尺形、LMN和正方形,CK是AK的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-4.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-13-4","revisionId":"euclid-13-4@raw-bc1e5fa87d8f5d80","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c62ea0debc25ef88565ef09908b3e7a6cd76d840712c076fb03fdb4b061b80f4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, further, AK was also proved equal to HG; therefore the gnomon LMN and the squares CK, HG are triple of the square HG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,另外,AK被证明等于HG;因此,曲尺形LMN和正方形CKHG是正方形HG的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-4.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-13-4","revisionId":"euclid-13-4@raw-bc1e5fa87d8f5d80","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4cc8418a171f3701aad34c37811e7e159a60cb59cffdc53fa816762f06962099","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the gnomon LMN and the squares CK, HG are the whole square AE and CK, which are the squares on AB, BC, while HG is the square on AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"曲尺形 LMN和正方形 CK,HG是整个正方形 AE和CK,即AB,BC的正方形,HG是AC的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-4.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-13-4","revisionId":"euclid-13-4@raw-bc1e5fa87d8f5d80","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b6fe5c959ba4a85c5e5abc9632360d49e38715501d0db8fb4481094d261741e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the squares on AB, BC are triple of the square on AC. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB和BC正方形是AC和AC正方形的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-4.source","contentId":"euclid-13-4","revisionId":"euclid-13-4@raw-bc1e5fa87d8f5d80","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f9868874ffb6356a820d8adebebf2ed5b4ee82c162396a974b7974ffd1bd5b7e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.4/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.4\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-4:euclid-6-def-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-4.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-def-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.4/","sourceLabel":"VI. Def. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-4:euclid-6-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-4.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.4/","sourceLabel":"VI. 17"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-17:euclid-13-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-17","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-17.proof.2","euclid-13-17.proof.16","euclid-13-17.proof.26"],"targetContentId":"euclid-13-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.17","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.17/","sourceLabel":"XIII. 4"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-4:euclid-6-def-3:explicit","id":"euclid-6-def-3","book":6,"number":3,"kind":"definition","title":"黄金分割：全段与大段之比等于大段与小段之比","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-4:euclid-6-17:explicit","id":"euclid-6-17","book":6,"number":17,"kind":"proposition","title":"三直线为连比例即首尾两线矩内直角形与中线上直角方形等首尾线矩内直角形与中线…","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-17:euclid-13-4:explicit","id":"euclid-13-17","book":13,"number":17,"kind":"proposition","title":"作内接于球的正十二面体","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-ratio","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
